@page "/about"
@layout BuilderLayout

<div class="about-page p-4">
    <div class="container-md">
        <h1>About REM</h1>
        <p class="color-fg-muted">REM is a free, client-side resume builder that lets you create, manage, and export professional resumes without sending your data anywhere.</p>

        <h2>Privacy first</h2>
        <p>Everything you type stays in your browser. Resumes are stored locally and never leave your device unless you explicitly export or download them.</p>

        <h2>Features</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Multiple resumes in one library</li>
            <li>Themes and color schemes</li>
            <li>Import / export as JSON, Markdown, and PDF</li>
            <li>Keyboard shortcuts (Ctrl+Z to undo, Ctrl+Y to redo)</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="color-fg-muted mt-4">Powered by <a href="https://duyhuynh.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">duyhuynh.net</a></p>
    </div>
</div>
